    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/614041c5c65be47ca490fa9e7ad8b5f1.poster.avif?t=1752019949\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/614041c5c65be47ca490fa9e7ad8b5f1.webm?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/614041c5c65be47ca490fa9e7ad8b5f1.mp4?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party Madness is a 2-4 player online party game. Compete with your friends in wacky mini-games, collect points, and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE MINIGAMES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mini-game in Party Madness is pure chaos! One moment you're escaping an angry octopus in the ocean, the next you're in the middle of a bank heist dodging lasers \u2014 and just when you think it\u2019s over, you\u2019re driving through a desert with meteors raining down on you. Dodge, laugh, and grab the cash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.poster.avif?t=1752019949\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.webm?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.mp4?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY GAME IS A NEW CHALLENGE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you face off against your friends, each game throws a different challenge your way. Race with cars, battle on boats, or outsmart your opponents in a variety of mini-games using different strategies to come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.poster.avif?t=1752019949\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.webm?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.mp4?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COSTUMES &amp; CUSTOMIZATION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with a wide range of costumes inspired by pirates, astronauts, samurais, and more! Unlock new outfits as you play and show off your unique style in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.poster.avif?t=1752019949\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.webm?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.mp4?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into a world of crazy fun! Party Madness is packed with non-stop action, laughs, and unexpected adventures. The madness awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/614041c5c65be47ca490fa9e7ad8b5f1.poster.avif?t=1752019949\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/614041c5c65be47ca490fa9e7ad8b5f1.webm?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/614041c5c65be47ca490fa9e7ad8b5f1.mp4?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party Madness is a 2-4 player online party game. Compete with your friends in wacky mini-games, collect points, and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNIQUE MINIGAMES!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mini-game in Party Madness is pure chaos! One moment you're escaping an angry octopus in the ocean, the next you're in the middle of a bank heist dodging lasers \u2014 and just when you think it\u2019s over, you\u2019re driving through a desert with meteors raining down on you. Dodge, laugh, and grab the cash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.poster.avif?t=1752019949\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.webm?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/8424c76829b7ef422faca0f098f92e68.mp4?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVERY GAME IS A NEW CHALLENGE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you face off against your friends, each game throws a different challenge your way. Race with cars, battle on boats, or outsmart your opponents in a variety of mini-games using different strategies to come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.poster.avif?t=1752019949\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.webm?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/07a4c844a66ecb890e7db004b575f2b1.mp4?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COSTUMES &amp; CUSTOMIZATION!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with a wide range of costumes inspired by pirates, astronauts, samurais, and more! Unlock new outfits as you play and show off your unique style in every match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.poster.avif?t=1752019949\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.webm?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3150970/extras/e06e0d43b9e7045bbdc88a22463b8956.mp4?t=1752019949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dive into a world of crazy fun! Party Madness is packed with non-stop action, laughs, and unexpected adventures. The madness awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
